config BIFROST_RGB_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool "Bifrost thumb RGB signal diagnostics"
    depends on SHELL && WS2812_STRIP_GPIO && ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW && ZMK_EXT_POWER
    help
      Add a USB shell command to inspect RGB state and hold the thumb LED
      data line low or high for multimeter measurements. Disabled by default.

config BIFROST_RGB_AUTO_TEST
    bool "Bifrost automatic RGB data-line voltage test"
    depends on WS2812_STRIP_GPIO && ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW && ZMK_EXT_POWER
    depends on !BIFROST_RGB_DIAGNOSTICS
    help
      Stop RGB animation after startup, then use a dedicated thread to drive
      LED power and alternate P0.27 low/high every ten seconds. RGB or external
      power subsystem errors do not cancel the GPIO voltage test.
